227
00:30:41,848 --> 00:30:51,888
何千回ともう一度 死に損なおう 希望と絶望の夜中を纏って
A thousand times over, let's miss death once more, draped in a night of hope and despair,

228
00:30:52,528 --> 00:31:01,368
